#: a5d78a49b81345d4bff8905ba6406206
msgid "The new ADS-B carrier boards overall footprint is identical to the standard versions and the main changes compared to the original carrier are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:23
#: dcce6e6345d84dc993525c19039da289
msgid "Integration of uAvonix ADS-B IN Receiver on Serial 5"
msgstr ""

